### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@structureGuid = REPLACE_WITH_32_CHAR_HEX_FROM_CREATE_RESPONSE

### List salary structures — with TYPE_LOCATION_COLS off, STRUCTURE_OBJ is selected by default so structure_type_code + location_obj match details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures?enterprise_id=1&page=1&limit=10&search=&status=ALL&sort_by=structure_code&sort_order=asc

### List salary structures — search alias (q): matches structure_code OR structure_name (case-insensitive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures?enterprise_id=1&page=1&limit=10&q=SAL_STR&status=ALL&sort_by=structure_code&sort_order=asc

### Sample list row (structure_type_code + location_obj match GET …/salary-structures-details shape for those keys)
# {
#   "structure_id": 10,
#   "structure_guid": "…",
#   "enterprise_id": 1,
#   "structure_code": "SAL_STR_001",
#   "structure_name": "Monthly Salary Structure",
#   "structure_type_code": "MONTHLY_FIXED",
#   "active_flag": "Y",
#   "location_obj": {
#     "lookup_value_id": 1052,
#     "lookup_value_guid": "4D4ED8AA817AE30EE0633519000A6222",
#     "lookup_type_id": 115,
#     "tenant_id": null,
#     "value_code": "KUWAIT",
#     "value_name": "Kuwait",
#     "display_sequence": 10,
#     "active_flag": "Y",
#     "type_code": "COMPONENT_LOCATION",
#     "type_name": "Component Location",
#     "type_description": "Optional description"
#   },
#   "created_by": "…",
#   "creation_date": "…",
#   "last_updated_by": "…",
#   "last_update_date": "…"
# }

### List — active only; optional structure_guid filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures?enterprise_id=1&status=ACTIVE

### Details URL — paginated list (no structure_id / structure_guid): full nested JSON per row (same 14 keys as single-detail; use a modest limit if payloads are large)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures-details?enterprise_id=1&page=1&limit=10&search=&status=ALL&sort_by=structure_code&sort_order=asc

### Details URL — one structure by path (numeric structure_id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures-details/10?enterprise_id=1

### Details URL — one structure by path (32-char hex structure_guid; hyphens optional)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures-details/{{structureGuid}}?enterprise_id=1

### Details URL — one structure by structure_id query (nested JSON sections)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures-details?enterprise_id=1&structure_id=10

### Details URL — by structure_guid (preferred for external clients)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures-details?enterprise_id=1&structure_guid={{structureGuid}}

### Create salary structure — success
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "structure_code": "SAL_STR_001",
  "structure_name": "Monthly Salary Structure",
  "structure_type_code": "MONTHLY",
  "currency_code": "KWD",
  "country_id": 1,
  "enterprise_id": 1,
  "description": "Default monthly salary structure",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "active_flag": "Y",
  "effective_from": "2026-01-01",
  "effective_to": null,
  "advanced_settings": {
    "enable_payroll_integration": "Y",
    "auto_calc_components": "Y",
    "enable_version_control": "Y",
    "require_multi_approval": "N",
    "enable_audit_logging": "Y",
    "allow_manual_override": "Y"
  },
  "financial_details": {
    "cost_center_code": "CC-100",
    "effective_from": "2026-01-01",
    "effective_to": null,
    "annual_budget_amount": 500000
  },
  "org_scope": {
    "country_code": "KUWAIT",
    "business_units": [
      "4C7F9CCE1AB49532E0633519000AA722"
    ],
    "employee_categories": [
      "STAFF",
      "MANAGEMENT"
    ]
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "component_id": 41,
      "display_sequence": 1,
      "calculation_method_code": "AMOUNT",
      "default_value": 100,
      "min_value": 100,
      "max_value": 1000,
      "active_flag": "Y"
    }
  ]
}

### Create — validation error (missing components)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "structure_code": "X",
  "structure_name": "Y",
  "effective_from": "2026-01-01",
  "components": []
}

### Update salary structure (partial body)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures/{{structureGuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "structure_name": "Updated Monthly Salary Structure",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Delete salary structure (no body)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/comp/salary-structures/{{structureGuid}}

### Sample success response (delete)
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Salary structure deleted successfully"
# }

### Sample not found (delete / update when row missing)
# HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
# {
#   "success": false,
#   "error": "Salary structure not found",
#   "error_code": "404"
# }

### Sample success response (create)
# HTTP/1.1 201 Created
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "structure_id": 123,
#     "structure_guid": "ABCD1234..."
#   }
# }

### Sample error response (Oracle)
# HTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error
# {
#   "success": false,
#   "error": "ORA-20001: ...",
#   "error_code": "20001"
# }
